# keystone-tex.packages — Keystone's own packages, atop the general base
#
# Installed in the Docker `keystone-tex` stage. `README.md` in the directory
# above owns the row format.

draftwatermark  watermark overlay for draft documents
endnotes        collected endnotes, gathered at the end of a document
fancyhdr        page layout, via page-layout-fancyhdr.tex
fvextra         fancyvrb extensions for code listings
hyperxmp        embeds keywords and metadata into the PDF Info dict and XMP stream
koma-script     KOMA-Script document classes, plus scrlayer-scrpage.sty
lettrine        drop caps
lineno          line numbering, used by pandoc
pdfcol          color stacks, a tcolorbox skins dependency
psnfss          provides pifont.sty for Dingbat symbols
ragged2e        hyphenation-preserving ragged-right
tcolorbox       colored boxes for callout and aside blocks
tikzfill        fill patterns, a tcolorbox skins dependency
